!! References Widget

Display the reference list for a DOI-backed literature tiddler.

!! Syntax

```
<$references tiddler="My Paper" />
```

!! Attributes

|!Attribute |!Type |!Description |
|tiddler |optional|Target paper title. Defaults to the current tiddler |

!! Requirements

* The target tiddler must exist.
* The target tiddler must have a valid `bibtex-doi` field.

!! Behavior

* The widget calls the `/literature/references/<doi>` route.
* Returned items are rendered as literature cards.
* If the DOI is missing or invalid, the widget shows an explanatory message.